      "One fixed landmark per named region replaces seven random points per subarea and the Cyclopedia UI. Distinct-area milestones remain ten, fifteen and twenty, using incremental survey counts ten/five/five rather than requiring forty-five regions. Intermediate outfit rewards are recorded at each Charos report. Map percentages, raid warnings, twenty-two regional achievements and map-completion titles are outside this chosen quest. Minimum level zero is an Oteryn choice because the base does not specify one."
